{"v":4,"catch":"在一卷衛生紙中使用 Joy-Con™ 玩的遊戲！","desc":"這是一款動作遊戲，您可以在其中準備帶有 Joy-Con™ 的衛生紙，然後將其在板上滾動。\n遊戲中有一張衛生紙與您的衛生紙相關聯。\n如果你左右卷衛生紙，遊戲中的衛生紙也會左右卷。\n\n\n\n“我的天哪！沒有衛生紙！” 讓我們幫助一個遇到大麻煩的人！\n\n你是家家戶戶的普通衛生紙，卻可以隨意捲起。\n現在有一個人需要衛生紙！\n\n你從廁所的天花板開始，走到那個男人身邊。\n但一路上各種陷阱等著你！\n\n通過避免或利用他們來幫助這個人。","publisher":"Takahiro Miyazawa","release":"2023-03-02","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/da19cad11cc54b17fac3335efb8a40cfbbe1735ce053bbd9027d07fd8fd69142.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a78898d8e1439dca40adef3af2ead2b8240d79d11f354c17222d973510747f56.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c2dcc112eef095e6c4a87b773e83da76e138baa52d23578cc9a809249415c9d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e9594dcc077647ed4ac342b2512a4d356ec22396c72a9a1177ea8598b3b325b4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a2c0cdbaa6a8fc87e26f705c76afbd71c7328d2d79a2deef624bb39f4364d2ea.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/edd42f4337cd82aa5f8505f0730fab88e27a1b828ca702db4149a94f33435f3a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e2c01a7e4000","dlc":[]}